{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04761","headline":"东都酺宴 · 张说","name":"东都酺宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尧舜传天下，同心致太平。\n吾君内举圣，远合至公情。\n锡命承丕业，崇亲享大名。\n二天资广运，两曜益齐明。\n道畅昆虫乐，恩深朽蠹荣。\n皇舆久西幸，留镇在东京。\n合宴千官入，分曹百戏呈。\n乐来嫌景遽，酒着讶寒轻。\n喜气连云阁，欢呼动洛城。\n人间知几代，今日见河清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}